WEBVTT

01:27.785 --> 01:28.905
LOVE & CROWN

01:28.985 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:31.105 --> 01:34.025
EPISODE 5

01:50.145 --> 01:51.305
Long live Your Majesty!

01:52.065 --> 01:54.225
Blessings upon Your Majesty!

01:54.865 --> 01:55.705
Father.

01:56.825 --> 01:57.865
The imperial dignity must be upheld.

01:57.945 --> 01:59.185
Rituals cannot be neglected.

02:03.185 --> 02:04.225
Sir, there's no need for such formality.

02:05.825 --> 02:06.705
Father,

02:06.785 --> 02:08.465
when you bow to me like that,
I'm not used to it.

02:08.545 --> 02:09.744
So let's not.

02:12.065 --> 02:14.225
In time, you will get used to it.

02:19.545 --> 02:20.585
Sir,

02:22.065 --> 02:24.465
is Luo Xianxue in the residence?

02:25.705 --> 02:27.825
He is. You wish to see him?

02:27.905 --> 02:30.385
The Empress has been
worried about his injuries.

02:33.465 --> 02:35.265
My dear, isn't that so?

02:35.985 --> 02:37.065
And if it is?

02:37.145 --> 02:39.225
Would you even allow me to visit him?

02:40.345 --> 02:41.185
As you wish.

03:09.105 --> 03:10.065
Your Majesty,

03:11.025 --> 03:14.425
she's been spoiled from childhood.

03:14.505 --> 03:16.265
I beg Your Majesty's pardon.

03:17.825 --> 03:20.945
I've heard you excel at tea.

03:22.185 --> 03:24.745
I wonder
if I might have the honor of a taste.

03:50.905 --> 03:51.905
Luo.

03:54.505 --> 03:55.625
Greetings, Your Majesty.

03:59.305 --> 04:01.545
Are you blaming me?

04:02.785 --> 04:03.625
Of course not.

04:04.305 --> 04:05.945
Now, you're the Empress.

04:06.545 --> 04:08.145
It's only right I bow to you.

04:09.105 --> 04:10.025
Rise.

04:18.705 --> 04:19.585
Your Majesty,

04:20.345 --> 04:22.625
it's just a scratch, not worth your worry.

04:25.025 --> 04:26.465
If you still see me as your little sister,

04:27.905 --> 04:29.305
stop calling me "Your Majesty".

04:35.025 --> 04:36.225
If anyone's to blame,

04:37.185 --> 04:38.225
it's me.

04:38.865 --> 04:41.025
Your Majesty, don't blame yourself.

04:42.105 --> 04:44.225
Your betrothal was set long ago.
You could never overrule him.

04:44.305 --> 04:45.385
He's the one at fault!

04:46.945 --> 04:48.505
He killed my master.

04:48.585 --> 04:50.025
But whatever the case,

04:50.785 --> 04:51.905
you're the Empress now.

04:57.585 --> 04:59.305
What exactly did he do to you?

05:00.985 --> 05:02.025
Before,

05:02.945 --> 05:04.145
I didn't know my place.

05:06.905 --> 05:07.985
But now,

05:09.345 --> 05:10.465
I've thought it through.

05:11.825 --> 05:14.465
I know what I must do for everyone's good.

05:15.625 --> 05:17.945
Our father grows older by the day.
He can't take upheaval.

05:18.625 --> 05:19.625
Since you're Empress,

05:19.705 --> 05:21.865
you should consider
how to ease his burdens.

05:22.625 --> 05:23.465
Ease Father's burdens?

05:25.785 --> 05:29.225
Yes. Empress Dowager Liu and Father
have long been at odds.

05:29.825 --> 05:31.265
Only by fulfilling your duty as Empress

05:31.865 --> 05:32.745
can you truly ease his burdens.

05:35.745 --> 05:38.265
How am I supposed to do that?

05:39.625 --> 05:41.225
Every day I see him,

05:42.385 --> 05:45.065
I think of my master,
I think of your hand,

05:46.825 --> 05:48.225
and I could kill him with one stroke.

05:50.305 --> 05:52.665
Even if you won't think of Father,
think of yourself.

05:52.745 --> 05:54.385
Empress Dowager Liu
holds the Phoenix Seal.

05:54.465 --> 05:55.425
She rules the inner palace.

05:56.025 --> 05:58.145
Without His Majesty's favor,
without his support,

05:58.225 --> 05:59.625
how will you survive the inner palace?

06:00.785 --> 06:01.985
I'm speaking from the heart!

06:10.705 --> 06:11.625
Don't worry.

06:13.145 --> 06:15.065
I'll look after myself in the palace.

06:17.785 --> 06:18.665
Your Majesty…

06:20.705 --> 06:22.345
Rumors that the
Emperor and Empress are at odds

06:23.025 --> 06:24.265
are everywhere.

06:25.345 --> 06:27.545
The Empress Dowager
will surely use it and bully you.

06:28.145 --> 06:31.025
You must rely on His Majesty
and secure the Phoenix Seal.

06:31.105 --> 06:33.345
Then our father can be at ease.

06:37.705 --> 06:38.785
Please think twice, Your Majesty!

06:42.305 --> 06:43.265
Luo,

06:46.265 --> 06:48.145
may I ask you a favor?

06:50.225 --> 06:51.385
Your Majesty, just say the word.

06:54.345 --> 06:55.585
I want to set up

06:57.705 --> 06:58.825
a spirit tablet for my master.

06:59.465 --> 07:01.025
I knew Your Majesty would wish this.

07:02.025 --> 07:03.345
I've already sought a proper mausoleum.

07:05.625 --> 07:06.465
All right.

07:08.945 --> 07:09.905
Thank you for seeing to it.

07:17.985 --> 07:20.505
Cangcang, take care.

07:28.825 --> 07:32.825
Two days ago, I obtained
some Wuyi Queshe Tea.

07:36.785 --> 07:39.785
Here. Please taste it, Your Majesty.

07:53.545 --> 07:56.185
A delicate fragrance
with a sweet, lingering finish.

07:56.265 --> 07:57.185
Fine tea.

08:00.025 --> 08:03.025
Today, Your Majesty
escorted the Empress home

08:03.105 --> 08:04.825
and now shares tea with me.

08:05.785 --> 08:09.145
This old minister is truly gratified.

08:09.225 --> 08:10.665
Sir, do you know

08:10.745 --> 08:13.145
about the heretical sect
in the martial world,

08:13.225 --> 08:14.505
the Lingbi Sect?

08:15.145 --> 08:16.745
Backed by someone at court,

08:16.825 --> 08:19.825
they assassinate the powerful
and eliminate rivals.

08:21.785 --> 08:24.145
I am ill-informed
and have never heard of it.

08:26.585 --> 08:31.545
I have proof
that Li Lu is its secret leader,

08:32.585 --> 08:33.425
which makes

08:34.105 --> 08:38.505
your ties to the Lingbi Sect
hard to explain.

08:38.585 --> 08:40.904
I truly didn't know Li Lu's identity,

08:41.505 --> 08:43.904
only that he was a martial master

08:43.985 --> 08:46.665
who saved Cangcang
and taught her the sword.

08:46.745 --> 08:47.985
Nothing more.

08:57.785 --> 08:58.785
Nothing more…

08:59.865 --> 09:01.145
Then tell me,

09:01.825 --> 09:05.065
why did I cut off Luo Xianxue's finger?

09:06.625 --> 09:10.025
You don't think
it was just out of jealousy, do you?

09:12.465 --> 09:15.425
Your Majesty's care for the Empress

09:16.385 --> 09:17.905
is painstaking indeed.

09:18.505 --> 09:20.945
I'm deeply grateful.

09:28.265 --> 09:30.905
We're all family. No need for thanks.

09:32.545 --> 09:34.425
By the way, in a few days,

09:34.505 --> 09:36.465
the Ministry of Personnel will
propose a talent recommendation system.

09:36.545 --> 09:38.505
I consider it workable
and intend to implement it.

09:39.745 --> 09:40.865
What say you, sir?

09:42.825 --> 09:44.825
If it benefits Great Qi,

09:45.425 --> 09:46.705
I will, of course,

09:47.945 --> 09:49.145
fully support it.

10:04.105 --> 10:06.545
Cangcang grew up away from strife

10:06.625 --> 10:08.065
pure and kind at heart.

10:08.145 --> 10:09.985
So she loves and hates with all her being,

10:10.065 --> 10:11.705
and despises evil as her enemy.

10:11.785 --> 10:14.185
She's been willful for a dozen years,

10:14.265 --> 10:17.025
but now she's the Empress.

10:17.105 --> 10:19.105
It's time she grew up.

10:19.185 --> 10:21.145
Have you said what must be said?

10:21.225 --> 10:22.185
Yes.

10:22.265 --> 10:24.785
As you instructed,
I told Young Lady everything.

10:26.185 --> 10:27.105
But Father,

10:27.945 --> 10:29.265
you know full well

10:29.345 --> 10:32.345
she still resents His Majesty
over Li Lu's death.

10:32.425 --> 10:35.545
Asking her to seek his favor
at a time like this, won't that…

10:35.625 --> 10:37.105
Xianxue,

10:37.945 --> 10:42.665
do you still think
I shouldn't have done this?

10:46.505 --> 10:48.665
I am Cangcang's father,

10:49.745 --> 10:52.705
and what I do
is certainly for her own good.

10:54.985 --> 10:58.905
His Majesty was born with cold poison.

10:59.825 --> 11:01.905
Even the imperial
physicians can't treat it.

11:03.345 --> 11:05.105
What if he were to…

11:09.625 --> 11:12.745
If Cangcang bears a prince soon,

11:13.825 --> 11:15.505
then she'll truly have real backing

11:15.585 --> 11:18.425
in the inner palace.

11:21.065 --> 11:22.385
Xianxue,

11:25.025 --> 11:27.065
this is the path she must take.

11:27.665 --> 11:28.865
All we can do

11:30.425 --> 11:31.625
is to pave the way for her,

11:32.425 --> 11:34.385
so she walks steadier

11:35.705 --> 11:37.065
and goes farther.

11:40.545 --> 11:41.625
Understood.

11:43.065 --> 11:45.185
My lady asked me to find
a mausoleum to honor Li Lu.

11:46.585 --> 11:47.545
Promise her.

11:48.425 --> 11:49.425
But

11:50.025 --> 11:52.065
don't let her know

11:52.145 --> 11:54.465
that Li Lu was the Ghost King.

11:56.345 --> 11:57.345
But I don't think

11:57.985 --> 11:59.025
she will let it go easily.

12:01.985 --> 12:03.345
Try to talk her down.

12:04.545 --> 12:06.145
Cangcang is soft-hearted.

12:06.225 --> 12:07.825
She'll always put the Ling family first.

12:08.625 --> 12:09.825
After all,

12:11.665 --> 12:13.265
we need to move on.

12:40.265 --> 12:43.425
YONGKANG MAUSOLEUM,
3 LI NORTH OF THE CAPITAL

12:58.865 --> 13:02.825
WUYING HALL

13:08.545 --> 13:09.585
Your Majesty.

13:10.465 --> 13:11.505
The Empress got a note by pigeon

13:11.585 --> 13:13.465
and slipped out of the palace.
You truly won't stop her?

13:14.705 --> 13:15.825
She'll come back.

13:17.145 --> 13:19.345
Keep me informed of her every move.

13:20.225 --> 13:21.305
Also,

13:21.905 --> 13:23.185
do not alert her.

13:23.985 --> 13:25.025
Understood.

13:36.745 --> 13:37.705
Master.

13:39.145 --> 13:40.105
I'm unfilial.

13:41.585 --> 13:43.825
I cannot pay respects
at your grave in person.

13:44.665 --> 13:45.905
I can only

13:48.705 --> 13:49.905
set up a spirit tablet for you here.

13:50.505 --> 13:52.025
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LI LU

13:52.105 --> 13:54.265
May it comfort your spirit in heaven.

14:01.065 --> 14:02.545
I brought you wine too.

14:07.185 --> 14:08.105
Though

14:08.825 --> 14:10.465
the Capital's wine is a bit light,

14:11.625 --> 14:12.865
and I'm not sure if you like it.

14:13.825 --> 14:14.785
Still,

14:16.105 --> 14:17.505
it's smooth and lingering.

14:18.665 --> 14:19.785
Please try it.

14:20.585 --> 14:23.105
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LI LU

14:36.865 --> 14:38.425
Let it go, Cangcang.

14:39.105 --> 14:42.025
Maybe His Majesty has his reasons.

14:45.545 --> 14:46.625
Reasons?

14:46.705 --> 14:49.345
What reason justifies
killing a man who kept to himself

14:50.305 --> 14:51.865
and did nothing but good?

14:58.145 --> 15:00.145
I roamed the martial world
with Master since I was little.

15:01.425 --> 15:02.825
He was unmatched in skill,

15:03.665 --> 15:05.185
almost without rival.

15:06.065 --> 15:08.665
Yet he was humble to all
and ever doing good.

15:09.865 --> 15:11.065
His only wish

15:11.625 --> 15:14.905
was that I grow up safe and happy.

15:15.865 --> 15:18.585
Master, I want those blossoms!

15:19.745 --> 15:22.225
All right. I'll pick them for you.

15:26.825 --> 15:28.105
What are you doing?

15:33.865 --> 15:34.705
What do you think you're doing?

15:41.345 --> 15:43.185
Thank you. Thank you.

15:43.265 --> 15:44.105
Sorry to trouble you.

15:47.505 --> 15:49.465
Master, you're amazing!

15:50.585 --> 15:51.465
I can't make sense of it.

15:52.825 --> 15:54.225
What reason could justify

15:55.225 --> 15:57.945
killing a man so good,

15:58.025 --> 15:59.425
one he never spoke of?

16:00.185 --> 16:02.465
Cangcang, the dead can't return.

16:03.265 --> 16:05.185
-Look past it.
-Stop.

16:26.785 --> 16:27.825
Show me your hand.

16:44.425 --> 16:45.265
Luo,

16:45.785 --> 16:47.225
you and Father

16:47.905 --> 16:50.905
are my closest family in this world.

16:52.465 --> 16:53.425
You're right.

16:54.545 --> 16:56.465
Since I'm the Empress now,

16:57.225 --> 16:58.665
I should use that position

16:59.265 --> 17:00.265
to live well in the palace.

17:01.865 --> 17:03.785
So I can keep
everyone in the Ling family safe.

17:06.025 --> 17:08.385
Cangcang, you've finally figured it out.

17:10.424 --> 17:11.305
Yes.

17:12.305 --> 17:13.704
I have.

17:14.745 --> 17:16.385
Until I learn the truth,

17:17.464 --> 17:19.105
I'll do my duty as Empress.

17:21.025 --> 17:22.105
Cangcang,

17:22.944 --> 17:25.745
-you still must find the truth?
-Right.

17:27.665 --> 17:29.585
Master's kindness to me runs deep.

17:30.105 --> 17:31.945
How could I let his death be in vain?

17:34.105 --> 17:36.745
But even if you uncover the truth,
what then?

17:44.465 --> 17:45.905
Then I'll repay every grudge

17:46.945 --> 17:48.145
and every grievance.

17:49.465 --> 17:50.665
I'll put an end to it all.

17:52.145 --> 17:53.625
The world will still be wide open.

18:00.745 --> 18:03.345
SPIRIT TABLET OF THE LATE LI LU

18:11.945 --> 18:14.065
-Your Majesty.
-Has the Empress returned?

18:14.145 --> 18:15.425
She has.

18:15.505 --> 18:17.585
She and Luo Xianxue visited a mausoleum

18:17.665 --> 18:18.825
and set up a spirit tablet for Li Lu.

18:18.905 --> 18:19.745
She just returned to Linghe Hall.

18:19.825 --> 18:21.065
She's in good spirits.

18:21.145 --> 18:22.905
Is that so? Good.

18:23.665 --> 18:26.625
Your Majesty,
why not tell Her Majesty the truth?

18:28.745 --> 18:30.265
Let her hate me

18:30.345 --> 18:32.825
is better than letting her learn it

18:32.905 --> 18:34.665
and suffer and grieve.

18:35.825 --> 18:38.585
Besides, the matter isn't over.

18:38.665 --> 18:41.265
-I don't want her dragged into it.
-Understood.

18:41.865 --> 18:43.825
How's the affair in Southern Chu
being handled?

18:44.625 --> 18:45.705
Rest easy.

18:45.785 --> 18:47.225
Song Lanxi has agreed.

18:47.305 --> 18:48.265
He can depart for the Capital at any time.

18:49.185 --> 18:50.025
Good.

18:50.785 --> 18:52.425
We're rolling out the
talent recommendation system.

18:52.505 --> 18:54.105
Make sure nothing goes wrong.

18:54.985 --> 18:56.545
Ensure this pilot batch of candidates,

18:56.625 --> 18:58.105
especially Song Lanxi,

18:58.185 --> 18:59.705
arrives safely in the Capital.

19:00.345 --> 19:01.185
Understood.

19:01.265 --> 19:04.345
LINGHE HALL

19:09.585 --> 19:10.705
Blessings upon Your Majesty.

19:15.225 --> 19:17.305
Why is it so cold in here?

19:19.305 --> 19:22.465
The steward eunuch says
our hall is short on attendants

19:23.065 --> 19:25.585
and His Majesty doesn't come,
so we don't get much charcoal.

19:28.465 --> 19:29.505
Is that so?

19:33.305 --> 19:34.625
How long have I been in the palace now?

19:35.465 --> 19:37.265
Today makes seven days.

19:37.865 --> 19:38.905
Keep combing.

19:58.705 --> 20:00.545
With a touch of
grooming, Your Majesty is peerless.

20:00.625 --> 20:02.705
His Majesty will be
smitten when he sees you!

20:05.865 --> 20:06.705
We're not going to see His Majesty.

20:08.705 --> 20:09.785
Then who are we visiting?

20:10.505 --> 20:13.745
We're going to see the Empress Dowager
and reclaim what is ours.

20:14.345 --> 20:16.185
Do you mean the Phoenix Seal?

20:16.265 --> 20:18.505
If you go like this, it may be risky…

20:19.105 --> 20:20.025
We'll go anyway.

20:21.225 --> 20:22.145
Come on.

20:36.825 --> 20:37.905
Your Majesty.

20:39.025 --> 20:39.985
Aunt Chan.

20:40.065 --> 20:41.505
The Empress Dowager is napping.

20:41.585 --> 20:42.825
No one may enter and disturb her.

20:44.225 --> 20:46.585
Aunt Chan, I've heard Mother loves cheese.

20:46.665 --> 20:48.745
So I asked my brother

20:48.825 --> 20:52.385
to bring fine cheese back from Xijiang
for her to enjoy.

20:52.465 --> 20:54.785
It was sent on an
eight-hundred-li rush to the Capital.

20:54.865 --> 20:56.745
The flavor will change with time.

20:56.825 --> 20:58.425
Please announce me.

20:59.505 --> 21:01.185
Your Majesty is thoughtful.

21:01.265 --> 21:03.665
However, the Empress Dowager

21:03.745 --> 21:05.745
feels she's put on weight lately,

21:05.825 --> 21:07.265
and is on a fasting regimen.

21:07.345 --> 21:10.225
So I'm afraid
she won't partake of this cheese.

21:10.905 --> 21:11.865
I see.

21:15.065 --> 21:16.385
What a pity.

21:18.505 --> 21:21.265
Then perhaps
I'll present it to you instead?

21:22.185 --> 21:24.145
Xiaoshan, take it in to Aunt Chan.

21:24.225 --> 21:25.145
Understood.

21:29.065 --> 21:30.745
The Empress Dowager is napping.

21:31.425 --> 21:34.385
No one may enter and disturb her.

21:38.105 --> 21:40.025
It's fine. We'll wait a bit longer.

21:40.705 --> 21:43.265
When the Empress Dowager wakes,
we'll go in then.

21:44.105 --> 21:45.745
Then please wait, Your Majesty.

21:46.945 --> 21:47.945
I'll go in and attend her.

21:49.345 --> 21:50.265
Hold.

21:53.345 --> 21:54.545
Since you're going in to serve,

21:55.145 --> 21:58.345
as her daughter-in-law,
I should go in to serve Mother as well

21:58.425 --> 21:59.305
to show my filial respect.

22:09.145 --> 22:10.705
The Empress's deportment is improper.

22:10.785 --> 22:11.825
How are you people attending her?

22:12.585 --> 22:14.905
Take them away.
Give them the forced-bend punishment

22:14.985 --> 22:15.945
for four hours!

22:19.985 --> 22:20.905
You dare strike me?

22:22.105 --> 22:23.545
I spoke kindly

22:23.625 --> 22:25.665
yet you threw your weight around
and ran roughshod.

22:26.225 --> 22:27.865
Am I not allowed to discipline you?

22:29.505 --> 22:31.585
Guards! Take her away.

22:31.665 --> 22:32.705
Understood!

22:32.785 --> 22:34.985
Your Majesty, at this rate…

22:35.065 --> 22:35.905
No hurry.

22:36.745 --> 22:37.785
Your Majesty.

22:39.585 --> 22:40.705
The Empress Dowager invites you.

22:44.745 --> 22:47.425
Then, I'll spare you for now.

23:02.305 --> 23:03.945
Greetings, Mother.

23:06.385 --> 23:09.025
You even struck my attendant.

23:09.665 --> 23:11.145
Quite the display of power.

23:13.785 --> 23:15.345
Mother, I am wronged!

23:16.065 --> 23:18.625
I came today to bring you cheese.

23:19.265 --> 23:20.385
But to my surprise,

23:20.465 --> 23:23.185
Aunt Chan said you'd grown fat

23:23.265 --> 23:25.385
and must fast a few
days before seeing anyone.

23:28.545 --> 23:30.545
Your Majesty, don't heed this liar!

23:31.665 --> 23:32.825
When did I ever say that?

23:34.265 --> 23:35.225
Mother, you hear that?

23:36.145 --> 23:37.865
Aunt Chan calls me a liar.

23:39.505 --> 23:40.345
Aunt Chan,

23:40.425 --> 23:42.425
you've served Mother for years.

23:43.105 --> 23:44.625
I do respect you.

23:46.145 --> 23:48.305
But after all,
I am the Empress of Great Qi.

23:48.905 --> 23:52.705
Young as I am,
you shouldn't call me a liar.

23:54.545 --> 23:56.465
Your Majesty, I've been wronged!

23:56.545 --> 23:58.225
Please judge clearly!

23:59.865 --> 24:02.305
Since Aunt Chan misspoke,

24:02.385 --> 24:03.905
she should be slapped.

24:04.665 --> 24:06.265
Attend! Drag her out.

24:07.745 --> 24:09.825
Thank you for your
just judgment, Your Majesty.

24:16.585 --> 24:17.985
Are you satisfied now?

24:18.945 --> 24:21.425
You're fair in reward and punishment.
I take the lesson.

24:22.625 --> 24:23.665
Thank you, Mother.

24:24.465 --> 24:27.185
I've ruled the inner palace for decades.

24:27.265 --> 24:29.625
You mustn't be soft-hearted,

24:30.425 --> 24:33.505
or the wretches will walk over you.

24:34.545 --> 24:36.145
Don't you agree?

24:41.585 --> 24:42.865
You're absolutely right.

24:43.705 --> 24:46.985
Mother,
it's hard work to manage the harem,

24:47.585 --> 24:49.545
so I'd like to share the burden.

24:50.225 --> 24:53.625
Managing the inner
palace is the Empress's duty,

24:53.705 --> 24:55.265
mine to fulfill.

24:55.945 --> 24:58.465
-Why not grant me the Phoenix Seal…
-You've

25:00.105 --> 25:01.785
been in the palace seven days?

25:06.065 --> 25:06.905
Yes.

25:07.705 --> 25:11.825
By rights,
I should pass you the Phoenix Seal.

25:13.065 --> 25:15.425
But your conduct falls short,

25:17.105 --> 25:18.825
how can you rule the inner palace?

25:18.905 --> 25:20.825
What do you mean by that, Mother?

25:20.905 --> 25:22.225
Where have I failed my duties?

25:23.265 --> 25:24.905
I hear

25:24.985 --> 25:27.225
His Majesty has yet
to stay at Linghe Hall.

25:28.345 --> 25:29.625
As the Emperor's wife,

25:30.265 --> 25:32.065
you've not fulfilled a wife's duty.

25:32.145 --> 25:33.745
That is the gravest failing.

25:34.545 --> 25:36.385
An Empress's chief duty

25:36.465 --> 25:40.185
is to extend the royal line
and carry on the heirs.

25:41.105 --> 25:43.505
To be the mother of the realm,

25:44.705 --> 25:46.505
be a mother first.

25:49.185 --> 25:52.265
If you have no legitimate son or daughter,

25:53.465 --> 25:55.265
your throne

25:56.185 --> 25:58.025
will be hard to hold.

25:59.505 --> 26:01.625
I fear your mind is elsewhere.

26:02.225 --> 26:03.905
So for now,

26:04.745 --> 26:06.505
I'll shoulder these burdens.

26:08.265 --> 26:09.465
As for the Phoenix Seal,

26:10.265 --> 26:12.585
I'll keep it for you.

26:13.625 --> 26:16.465
When you've fulfilled an Empress's duties,

26:17.265 --> 26:19.145
I'll hand it over.

26:21.185 --> 26:22.465
I'm a bit tired.

26:22.545 --> 26:24.665
You may withdraw.

26:28.305 --> 26:29.305
Understood.

26:30.185 --> 26:31.185
I'll take my leave.

26:35.705 --> 26:36.905
I also hear

26:37.705 --> 26:39.545
the Emperor was just outside

26:40.745 --> 26:43.345
yet didn't speak up for you.

26:44.385 --> 26:47.625
As one who's been through it,
let me advise you:

26:48.345 --> 26:52.345
Reflect on yourself
and win back his favor.

27:14.625 --> 27:15.985
I still can't get around him.

27:16.585 --> 27:17.665
Mind your words, Your Majesty.

27:30.545 --> 27:32.425
-Your Majesty.
-How is the Empress?

27:33.145 --> 27:35.465
Since returning, all is normal.

27:35.545 --> 27:37.345
She showed no other strong reaction,

27:37.425 --> 27:39.825
only that
she took out a pear blossom hairpin.

27:47.625 --> 27:49.505
We're going to visit Master tomorrow.

27:49.585 --> 27:51.225
Why are you still up so late?

27:52.785 --> 27:53.625
Cangcang,

27:54.425 --> 27:55.945
I have a gift for you.

27:57.065 --> 27:57.905
What is it?

28:03.785 --> 28:05.185
What a beautiful hairpin!

28:06.425 --> 28:07.865
My home has a pear orchard,

28:07.945 --> 28:09.625
planted by my parents.

28:10.305 --> 28:11.425
When the blossoms are in full bloom,

28:11.985 --> 28:14.305
I'll take you there, all right?

28:18.105 --> 28:19.585
That depends on my master's permission.

28:22.065 --> 28:23.345
And if he says no?

28:24.745 --> 28:25.865
Then we won't go.

28:30.225 --> 28:31.985
Anyway, just put it on.

28:43.585 --> 28:44.425
Does it look good?

28:46.145 --> 28:47.305
It does.

29:33.905 --> 29:35.305
Have the pear blossoms
in Qinyuan Garden bloomed?

29:35.385 --> 29:37.305
They've budded but not opened yet.

29:39.345 --> 29:41.705
I want to see a sea of
white blossoms like snow.

29:43.145 --> 29:44.945
Hongqing, see to it.

29:45.985 --> 29:46.985
Understood.

29:52.345 --> 29:53.945
-Put that over there.
-Yes, sir.

29:54.745 --> 29:55.865
Set this one here.

29:55.945 --> 29:57.225
Leave this here.

29:57.305 --> 29:58.665
Stoke the fire higher.

30:01.305 --> 30:03.785
You two, bring a few more braziers.

30:03.865 --> 30:04.865
Yes, sir!

30:06.425 --> 30:07.305
Commander Li.

30:08.145 --> 30:09.225
Eunuch Feng.

30:09.305 --> 30:13.345
Why so many braziers
throughout the garden?

30:13.425 --> 30:14.265
Are you

30:14.945 --> 30:17.865
building a warm frame
to force an early bloom?

30:17.945 --> 30:19.225
White as snow.

30:39.545 --> 30:40.425
Your Majesty, look!

30:40.505 --> 30:41.745
The pear blossoms are all open.

30:41.825 --> 30:43.265
I didn't lie to you.

30:43.345 --> 30:44.185
They are.

30:44.785 --> 30:47.225
Not one was open days ago,

30:48.105 --> 30:49.145
and today the whole garden's in bloom.

30:52.065 --> 30:53.105
Do you like it?

30:53.185 --> 30:55.625
Shall I cut two sprays for a vase?

31:01.705 --> 31:03.945
Here comes His Majesty!

31:06.865 --> 31:08.425
If I can't secure the Phoenix Seal,

31:08.505 --> 31:11.185
never mind uncovering Master's death,

31:11.265 --> 31:13.145
I won't survive a day in the harem.

31:15.745 --> 31:16.705
Greetings, Your Majesty.

31:18.785 --> 31:21.465
Do you like this garden of pear blossoms?

31:22.185 --> 31:23.425
I do.

31:23.505 --> 31:26.385
At first sight of them,
I thought of Your Majesty.

31:27.185 --> 31:29.425
I meant to send for you,

31:29.505 --> 31:31.225
but you came at once.

31:31.305 --> 31:32.985
Are you here to admire them too?

31:35.065 --> 31:37.465
So, have you made up your mind?

31:39.865 --> 31:41.865
I have. Right now,

31:42.585 --> 31:44.225
I have made up my mind.

31:44.305 --> 31:45.905
We are husband and wife.

31:45.985 --> 31:47.785
I shouldn't hold resentment toward you.

31:48.585 --> 31:49.745
Your Majesty,

31:50.345 --> 31:52.025
at Linghe Hall,

31:52.705 --> 31:54.705
the nights are bitterly cold.

31:55.985 --> 31:58.265
Will you come keep me company tonight?

32:08.905 --> 32:10.505
Since when

32:10.585 --> 32:13.385
did I become a tool for you to toy with?

32:42.785 --> 32:43.625
Your Majesty,

32:43.705 --> 32:45.505
this is a new medicine
from the Imperial Preceptor

32:45.585 --> 32:47.545
to treat your cold sickness.

32:47.625 --> 32:49.745
What is it you painted, Your Majesty?

32:51.625 --> 32:54.145
Nothing, just a few casual strokes.

32:55.265 --> 32:57.905
I hear you viewed pear blossoms all day.

33:05.105 --> 33:06.345
This spring is chill.

33:06.425 --> 33:09.665
Their scent can affect the body.

33:11.425 --> 33:13.465
Beware a bout of wheezing.

33:14.505 --> 33:15.425
Hereafter,

33:17.225 --> 33:18.505
best avoid Qinyuan.

33:20.345 --> 33:23.265
I was born with the cold sickness.

33:23.945 --> 33:24.985
What has it to do with pear blossoms?

33:26.145 --> 33:27.465
I'm not that delicate.

33:28.425 --> 33:29.465
Fair point.

33:31.665 --> 33:33.145
The reform you seek

33:33.225 --> 33:35.305
will shake the nobles' interests.

33:36.025 --> 33:36.945
I fear

33:38.425 --> 33:39.585
Grand Tutor Ling won't support it.

33:41.385 --> 33:44.425
In court, only Minister Xing

33:44.505 --> 33:45.785
can counter him.

33:46.385 --> 33:48.105
Though he's of the Empress Dowager's line,

33:49.585 --> 33:50.825
there's room to win him over.

33:56.105 --> 33:57.465
I hear

33:57.545 --> 33:59.665
Minister Xing has a beloved daughter.

34:00.505 --> 34:01.505
If Your Majesty

34:02.185 --> 34:03.945
takes her as a consort,

34:04.905 --> 34:06.905
-he'll surely serve you.
-Madam…

34:06.985 --> 34:08.304
Your Majesty, remember:

34:09.025 --> 34:10.385
you married the Empress

34:10.465 --> 34:11.665
to counter Grand Tutor Ling.

34:11.744 --> 34:13.304
Now, to keep the balance,

34:14.344 --> 34:16.425
taking Minister Xing's daughter

34:16.505 --> 34:17.545
is just as necessary.

34:20.425 --> 34:23.465
My harem requires no concern from you.

34:29.225 --> 34:30.625
I overstepped.

34:30.705 --> 34:34.505
As Imperial Preceptor,
you should not dabble in such affairs.

34:34.585 --> 34:37.705
Your Majesty,
the Empress may not be your foe,

34:40.505 --> 34:41.945
but she cannot be your soft spot.

35:33.185 --> 35:35.425
Your Majesty, it's late.

35:35.505 --> 35:36.505
Let's give up waiting.

35:37.385 --> 35:39.665
What do you think
His Majesty is doing now?

35:42.985 --> 35:44.705
I asked around.

35:45.225 --> 35:47.905
His Majesty
has been reading memorials at Wuying Hall

35:48.545 --> 35:49.665
and went nowhere else.

35:53.225 --> 35:55.065
Enough. Let's go rest.

35:55.665 --> 35:57.105
Understood.

35:59.985 --> 36:00.865
Let's wait a bit longer.

36:34.585 --> 36:35.425
Right now,

36:36.145 --> 36:37.825
I have made up my mind.

36:37.905 --> 36:39.305
We are husband and wife.

36:39.385 --> 36:41.505
I shouldn't hold resentment toward you.

36:42.185 --> 36:43.785
At Linghe Hall,

36:44.425 --> 36:46.465
nights are bitterly cold.

36:47.745 --> 36:50.025
Will you come keep me company tonight?

36:59.585 --> 37:02.065
Your Majesty, your health comes first.

37:02.745 --> 37:03.945
Shall we retire?

37:05.905 --> 37:06.865
No need.

37:13.025 --> 37:14.065
Your Majesty,

37:15.225 --> 37:17.105
you're holding the memorial upside down.

37:40.745 --> 37:44.265
None of you
supports the talent recommendation system?

37:46.265 --> 37:49.585
If you have thoughts, speak freely.

37:50.305 --> 37:51.425
The new system makes sense,

37:51.505 --> 37:53.505
but it will be hard to carry out.

37:53.585 --> 37:54.905
With the Grand Tutor silent,

37:54.985 --> 37:56.505
we dare not say much.

37:56.585 --> 37:57.745
-Yes.
-Exactly.

37:57.825 --> 37:58.985
Reasonable.

38:07.385 --> 38:08.265
Your Majesty,

38:08.345 --> 38:11.945
the system selects
talent beyond old rules.

38:12.025 --> 38:14.465
But scholars vary by region.

38:14.545 --> 38:17.785
Bringing them to court rashly
may be unwise.

38:17.865 --> 38:19.705
The Grand Tutor never proposed it before.

38:19.785 --> 38:21.665
Best to see where he stands now.

38:21.745 --> 38:22.865
That's sensible.

38:22.945 --> 38:24.505
Not so. A matter this big

38:24.585 --> 38:26.625
can't be decided in a moment.

38:31.545 --> 38:33.505
By the way, in a few days,

38:33.585 --> 38:35.025
the Ministry of Personnel will
propose a talent recommendation system.

38:35.705 --> 38:37.585
I consider it workable
and intend to implement it.

38:38.865 --> 38:39.945
What say you, Sir?

38:41.905 --> 38:43.905
If it benefits Great Qi,

38:44.505 --> 38:45.865
I will, of course,

38:47.025 --> 38:48.425
fully support it.

38:50.385 --> 38:51.265
Your Majesty,

38:51.905 --> 38:53.345
no one in court supports the system.

38:54.665 --> 38:55.745
What now?

38:57.305 --> 39:00.145
I expected today's pushback

39:00.225 --> 39:01.545
and have a plan.

39:02.345 --> 39:04.505
-Hold for now.
-Understood.

39:05.585 --> 39:06.505
Time to go to Nanrong Palace now.

39:08.185 --> 39:09.185
Get my medicine.

39:10.505 --> 39:11.345
Understood.

39:14.625 --> 39:15.945
Your Majesty,

39:16.025 --> 39:17.785
the Empress waited all night

39:17.865 --> 39:19.065
and just fell asleep.

39:19.985 --> 39:21.465
-Wufu.
-Here.

39:21.545 --> 39:22.705
Find a way

39:22.785 --> 39:24.425
to move the spies from her side.

39:25.905 --> 39:26.745
Understood.

39:36.545 --> 39:37.465
Madam,

39:38.385 --> 39:39.585
are the elixirs ready?

39:46.345 --> 39:50.265
Commander Li,
why are you here alone today?

39:50.345 --> 39:52.865
Doesn't His Majesty
always stop by after court?

39:53.505 --> 39:55.105
He went to Linghe Hall today.

39:59.345 --> 40:01.945
This batch has new herbs added.

40:03.025 --> 40:04.025
When His Majesty takes it,

40:04.105 --> 40:07.625
I must be present
to take his pulse and observe.

40:11.545 --> 40:12.385
This time,

40:13.105 --> 40:14.545
let me deliver it.

40:14.625 --> 40:15.945
Please don't put me in a bind.

40:19.665 --> 40:22.025
Xiaoyue! Xiaoyue!

40:23.505 --> 40:24.545
Quiet down.

40:24.625 --> 40:26.705
Her Majesty was up all night
and just fell asleep.

40:27.705 --> 40:30.505
Xiaoyue, Eunuch Yang from the
Household asks for you.

40:30.585 --> 40:31.585
Me?

40:31.665 --> 40:33.585
Yes, go on. They're waiting.

40:34.865 --> 40:37.065
-Xiaoshan, I'll be right back.
-All right.

40:43.625 --> 40:45.585
His Majesty said he wouldn't come.

40:45.665 --> 40:47.185
Why lose sleep waiting?

40:47.265 --> 40:48.785
What's the point?

40:51.065 --> 40:52.105
Forgive me, Your Majesty!

41:26.025 --> 41:26.905
Cangcang,

41:28.105 --> 41:29.305
I'm truly sorry.

41:31.345 --> 41:33.105
But if you knew the truth,

41:33.625 --> 41:35.625
how would you face your master?

41:37.985 --> 41:39.625
And how could you bear it?

41:43.425 --> 41:44.465
Your Majesty!

41:52.985 --> 41:54.105
You finally came.

41:55.385 --> 41:57.545
I was just passing by and looking in.

41:58.145 --> 42:01.025
I didn't expect
you'd be sleeping in broad daylight.

42:01.105 --> 42:02.265
What conduct is that?

42:04.785 --> 42:07.145
Since you're here,
stay and keep me company.

42:08.425 --> 42:09.825
I still have matters to attend to.

42:09.905 --> 42:12.065
If you wish to sleep, then sleep.

42:12.745 --> 42:14.265
Do you dislike me so much?

42:14.345 --> 42:15.305
You won't spare me a glance?

42:22.745 --> 42:25.425
Why do you want me to stay?

42:27.865 --> 42:30.265
Do you remember this pear blossom hairpin?

42:32.745 --> 42:34.865
If you don't like it, throw it away.

42:34.945 --> 42:37.225
I like it! Put it on me.

42:43.705 --> 42:44.625
If not,

42:45.585 --> 42:47.225
share a drink with me. Just one cup.

42:47.825 --> 42:50.345
After this cup, we're back to how we were.

42:51.265 --> 42:52.105
All right?
